# npu_ss_dma: 性質與歸納不變式在 rtl/npu/npu_ss_dma.sv 的 `ifdef FORMAL 區塊 (OUT=4, DW=8; 計數器為實際寬度 16 bit; DMA 不運算資料, 每個 bit 獨立搬移, 故 DW=8 的資料完整性推廣到 512)
[tasks]
prove
cover

[options]
prove: mode prove
prove: depth 5
cover: mode cover
cover: depth 30

[engines]
smtbmc z3

[script]
read_verilog -sv -formal npu_ss_dma.v
chparam -set OUT 4 -set DW 8 npu_ss_dma
prep -top npu_ss_dma

[files]
npu_ss_dma.v
